---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /free-tools/
title: Free tools
description: Free structured-literacy and special-education tools — one from each lane. Enter your email and get sent straight to the free download on TPT.
---
<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">Start free</p>
    <h1>Free tools</h1>
    <p class="lead">One free resource from each lane. Enter your email and we'll send you straight to the free download on Teachers Pay Teachers — and drop the link in your inbox so it's always one click away.</p>
    <div class="grid grid--3 mt-2">
      {%- for f in products %}{% if f.free %}
      <a class="card card--lane" style="--accent:{{ f.color }}" href="/resources/{{ f.slug }}/">
        <span class="lane-tag">{{ f.laneLabel }}</span>
        <h3>{{ f.name }}</h3>
        <p>{{ f.subhead }}</p>
        <span class="card-foot"><strong>Get it free →</strong></span>
      </a>
      {%- endif %}{% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
